payload.ingredientsText:
hazelnut filling: sugar, hazelnuts, vegetable oil (sheanut oil, sunflower oil, coconut oil), cocoa butter, unsweetened chocolate, nonfat milk powder, cocoa powder, whole milk powder, sunflower lecithin, natural flavor, anhydrous milk fat;  
milk chocolate: sugar, whole milk powder, unsweetened chocolate, cocoa butter, natural vanilla flavor, soy lecithin;  
dark chocolate: unsweetened chocolate, sugar, milk fat, cocoa butter, natural vanilla flavor, soy lecithin;  
white chocolate: sugar, cocoa butter, whole milk powder, soy lecithin, natural vanilla flavor;  
caramel filling: glucose syrup (corn, wheat), sweetened condensed milk (nonfat milk, sugar), coconut oil, mono - and diglycerides, sodium phosphate, salt, natural flavor;  
unsweetened chocolate;  
unsalted butter: cream (milk), lactic acid starter culture;  
crispy rice: rice flour, sugar, salt, cocoa butter;  
waffle crisps: wheat flour, sugar, unsalted butter (cream (milk), lactic acid starter culture), egg, wheat starch, salt, ammonium bicarbonate;  
light whipping cream: cream, nonfat milk, carrageenan;  
coffee;  
sea salt;  
soy lecithin;  
corn oil;  
natural flavor;  
citric acid;  
water.  

contains milk, egg, soy, wheat, hazelnuts. may contain almond, pecan, pistachio, sesame, walnut.
